B.Ld=s(["I like cats.","We can run.","Dogs can bark.","Birds can fly.","I see you.","Look at me.","The cat sat.","My dog ran.","I love mom.","Come and play.","I can hop.","Fish can swim.","It is red.","We go home.","Do you know?","Who is there?","What is that?","Yes I can.","I am big.","Get the ball.","Mom can cook.","The sun shines.","Ducks like water.","Frogs can jump.","I see stars.","Time to eat.","Let us play.","I like pizza.","Wow, look up!","Open the door.","Sit down please.","I can read.","Dad is here.","Cats like milk.","Is it big?","Can you hop?","Hello, my friend.","We like books.","Rain is wet.","Stop and look!","I can write.","Pigs say oink.","Cows say moo.","Run, run, run!","Good night, moon."],t.s)
B.K7=s(["The dog likes to run.","I see a red bird.","We play in the sun.","Mom has a big hat.","The frog can jump high.","I like to eat apples.","The sky is very blue.","Do you like my hat?","Can we go to school?","A fish swims in water.","The bus is very big.","I have two little feet.","Look at the bright moon!","My cat sleeps all day.","We read a book today.","The baby is sleeping now.","Birds build nests in trees.","I can draw a flower.","What is your favorite color?","Where is my red ball?","The rabbit hops in grass.","I love my little puppy.","Snow falls on the hill.","The sun comes up early.","Please close the big door.","We ate lunch at school.","He kicked the ball far.","She wears a pretty dress.","Ducks swim in the pond.","I can tie my shoes.","Our teacher reads us stories.","The moon shines at night.","Can you hear the music?","A turtle walks very slowly.","The farmer feeds the cows.","Is the water cold today?","We plant seeds in spring.","I wash my hands often.","Look out for the puddle!","The train goes very fast.","Who wants to play outside?","A bee buzzes near flowers.","I feel so happy today!","Put on your warm coat.","The lion roars very loud.","My family loves to picnic."],t.s)
B.Kh=s(["The little puppy chased the red ball.","I like to play outside with friends.","My brother and I built a tall tower.","The yellow sun shines over the green hills.","We went to the park after lunch today.","Can you help me find my missing shoe?","The tiny frog jumped onto a big leaf.","Every morning the birds sing in my tree.","I put on my coat and went outside.","Grandma made us warm soup for dinner.","The teacher read a funny story to us.","A big brown bear sleeps in the cave.","Please wash your hands before you eat lunch.","My favorite thing to do is to draw.","The moon and the stars light up the night.","We saw a rainbow after the rain stopped.","The farmer planted corn in the big field.","What is your favorite animal at the zoo?","The kitten drank milk and then took a nap.","I can write my name all by myself!","Our class made a pretty picture of the sea.","The train goes over the bridge every day.","He gave his little sister a big hug.","The ducks swam across the pond to the shore.","I want to be a doctor when I grow up.","There are many colors in a box of crayons.","The wind blew my kite up into the sky.","Mom and Dad took us to the beach.","It is fun to jump in the puddles!","The snowman wore a red scarf and a hat.","Can we plant flowers in the garden today?","My dog waits for me at the door.","The bus stops at the corner near my house.","We found shiny shells on the sandy beach.","She is learning to ride her new bike.","The baby bird is waiting for her mother.","I like to read books before I go to bed.","Look at the big yellow moon tonight!","The little turtle walked slowly to the water.","A bee flew from flower to flower all day.","Why is the sky blue and the grass green?","We sang a happy song at school today.","The monkey swung from branch to branch.","My teacher has a big jar of stickers."],t.s)
